        "readable_text": "Prompt:\nWhich of the following is equivalent to [MATH: 3\\ln sqrt(x) \u2212 12\\ln sqrt(x)?]\n\nChoices:\na. [MATH: 9\\ln (x)]\nb. [MATH: \u2212 4\\ln sqrt(x)]\nc. [MATH: \u2212 9\\ln sqrt(x)]\nd. [MATH: 9\\ln sqrt(x)]\ne. [MATH: 36\\ln (x)]"
